{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/learn/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/page,_N_T_/learn/dalio-principles-and-bad-days"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--2DJ2zhzL_dHSrK5QsdDKA--><html lang=\"zh-TW\" data-density=\"comfortable\" data-font-size=\"standard\" class=\"__variable_07e1b6 __variable_cc7473 h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/6e1768769e6f59a2-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ab2e3a11646b0499-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/75c047ba52e43fcc.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/aa90c9a426448e43.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/e55779c04dd245e2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8c57d5c3b938342e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/3eaf36e367672966.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-ab54a41c275880be.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-acf4587a940f1946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/learn/%5Bslug%5D/page-f7b99344f7e2ee16.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>達利歐原則怎麼讀？極端日3個提醒比口號重要｜股市大佬 TradeBoss</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"瑞·達利歐的《原則》與公開演講很好摘成金句。對看盤的人，比較有用的不是「追求真理」這種大詞，是極端日會發生的三件事：看起來分散的東西可能一起跌、事後記憶會美化、以及當下沒有原則就只剩情緒。二〇〇八年那篇寫過假分散；這篇用他的公開框架再對一次。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-theme');if(t!=='light'&&t!=='dark')t='dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);document.documentElement.style.colorScheme=(t==='light'?'light':'dark');}catch(e){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark');}})();(function(){try{if(localStorage.getItem('obsidian-comfort-read')==='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('comfort-read');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var s=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-updown');if(s==='us')document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-updown','us');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var prefs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('bs-preferences-v1')||'{}');var root=document.documentElement;prefs=prefs&&typeof prefs==='object'?prefs:{};root.setAttribute('data-font-size',['standard','large','xlarge','huge'].indexOf(prefs.fontSize)>=0?prefs.fontSize:'standard');root.setAttribute('data-density',prefs.density==='compact'?'compact':'comfortable');}catch(e){}})();</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground selection:bg-cyan/30 review-mode pb-40 lg:pb-16\" data-review-theme=\"dark\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link fixed left-3 top-3 z-[80] -translate-y-24 rounded-xl bg-accent px-4 py-2 font-black text-bg shadow-lg transition focus:translate-y-0\">跳到主要內容</a><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_wrap__LIQ8G\"><article class=\"LearnArticle_article__2nBbk\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_meta__etj_G\"><a class=\"LearnArticle_cat__GQMlg\" href=\"/learn?c=stories\">人物與市場史</a><span class=\"LearnArticle_read__QEj6a\">閱讀約 3 分鐘</span></p><h1 class=\"LearnArticle_title__0_la8\">達利歐原則怎麼讀？極端日3個提醒比口號重要</h1><details class=\"LearnArticle_toc__LcSAa\"><summary class=\"LearnArticle_tocSummary__YBddG\">本文目錄</summary><ol class=\"LearnArticle_tocList__Rq_Lz\"><li><a href=\"#sec-1\">一、金句先放下</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-2\">二、極端日三個提醒</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-3\">三、痛苦要當資料</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-4\">四、不要把經濟機器當預測儀</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-5\">五、最小動作</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-6\">常見問題 FAQ</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-7\">總結</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-8\">延伸閱讀</a></li></ol></details><div class=\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\">瑞·達利歐的《原則》與公開演講很好摘成金句。對看盤的人，比較有用的不是「追求真理」這種大詞，是極端日會發生的三件事：看起來分散的東西可能一起跌、事後記憶會美化、以及當下沒有原則就只剩情緒。二〇〇八年那篇寫過假分散；這篇用他的公開框架再對一次。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\"><b class=\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\">本文重點</b><ul class=\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\"><li>原則要寫在晴天，雨天才用得上</li><li>分散在系統性壓力下會暫時失效，要先假設這一層</li><li>痛苦若不記錄，會變成後見之明</li></ul></div><section id=\"sec-1\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">一、金句先放下</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">公開文本鼓勵把決策寫成原則，方便重複與修正。這和交易日誌、失效條件是同一家族。金句傳播時少了「要寫下來」這半句，於是原則變成氣氛。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>原則是寫下來的句子</li><li>氣氛不能執行</li><li>修正要有版本</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-2\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">二、極端日三個提醒</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">第一，相關性會在壞日子裡上升，你以為分開的賭注會變成同一個。第二，流動性會先消失，離開比模型慢。第三，組織或個人都會在壓力下改規則，除非規則事先鎖住。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\"><table class=\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\"><thead><tr><th>晴天看起來</th><th>極端日常見</th><th>原則該先寫</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>分散很穩</td><td>一起被賣</td><td>最壞加總是多少</td></tr><tr><td>模型很準</td><td>模型輸入斷掉</td><td>沒行情時怎麼辦</td></tr><tr><td>我很理性</td><td>記憶會改寫</td><td>當天就要記</td></tr><tr><td>還有時間</td><td>流動性先走</td><td>誰能叫我減</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"sec-3\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">三、痛苦要當資料</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">公開框架把痛苦當成學習訊號。交易版是：痛的那筆要在當天寫下理由與違規，不能等記憶變順。後見之明那篇是同一把刀。</p><ol class=\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\"><li>痛的當天寫</li><li>只寫事實與違規</li><li>隔週再解釋</li></ol><figure class=\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\">✓加總上限✓減碼觸發✓當天記錄</div><figcaption class=\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\">晴天先寫</figcaption></figure></section><section id=\"sec-4\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">四、不要把經濟機器當預測儀</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">他的公開比喻把經濟講成機器。機器圖好懂，也被人拿來預測下一季。本篇不走預測。機器圖最多幫你分類：這是債務、現金流，還是信心問題。分類錯了，原則會用錯格子。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>比喻用來分類</li><li>分類不是時間表</li><li>預測留給別人</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-5\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">五、最小動作</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">寫三條只在壞日子用的句子：加總曝險上限、減碼觸發、當天記錄的截止時間。晴天覺得多餘，雨天才知道多餘的是沒寫。</p></section><section id=\"sec-6\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">常見問題 FAQ</h2><div class=\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\"><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>是不是要學他的全天候想法？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">那是機構框架。散戶能學的是「壞日子加總」與「原則事前寫」。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>分散是不是沒用？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">日常有用，極端日會打折。要先假設打折，不是先假設永遠有用。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>原則會不會變成教條？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">公開框架包含修正。有版本的原則才不是教條。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>和二〇〇八年那篇重複嗎？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">那篇講事件結構；這篇講人物框架怎麼對到壞日子。</p></details></div></section><section id=\"sec-7\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">總結</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">達利歐能用的是事前寫下的原則，不是金句。極端日：分散可能一起失效、流動性先走、痛苦要當天記錄。</p></section><section id=\"sec-8\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">延伸閱讀</h2><ul class=\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\"><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/2008-financial-crisis-why-diversification-failed-together\">2008 金融海嘯</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/hindsight-bias-in-trading\">後見之明</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/what-max-drawdown-really-means\">最大回撤</a></li></ul></section><div class=\"LearnArticle_related__9qV55\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_relatedTitle__RXfrl\">相關文章</p><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/2008-financial-crisis-why-diversification-failed-together\">2008 金融海嘯</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/hindsight-bias-in-trading\">後見之明</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/what-max-drawdown-really-means\">最大回撤</a></div></div></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[81259,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[89379,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[98924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[10021,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[10528,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"s